014 required when using Include other model types.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "homolog", "options": [["Homolog models only", "homolog", true], ["All model types", "all", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "history", "inputs": [{"model_class": "Conditional", "name": "wildcard_annot", "type": "conditional", "cases": [{"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "homolog", "inputs": [{"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "wildcard_annotation", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "WildCARD annotation FASTA \u2014 homolog models", "help": "wildcard_database_v*.fasta. To prepare: download card-variants.tar.bz2 from https://card.mcmaster.ca/download, extract and decompress all .gz files inside, then run: rgi wildcard_annotation --input_directory DIR --version VERSION --card_json card.json. Required to use Include wildcard variants.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["fasta", "fasta.gz"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_1929", "format_1929"], "edam_data": ["data_2044", "data_2044"]}, "multiple": false, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "tag": null}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "all", "inputs": [{"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "wildcard_annotation_all_models", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "WildCARD annotation FASTA \u2014 all models", "help": "wildcard_database_v*_all.fasta. To prepare: download card-variants.tar.bz2 from https://card.mcmaster.ca/download, extract and decompress all .gz files inside, then run: rgi wildcard_annotation --input_directory DIR --version VERSION --card_json card.json. Both FASTAs (homolog-only and all-models) are produced by the same command. Required when combining Include wildcard variants with Include other model types.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["fasta", "fasta.gz"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_1929", "format_1929"], "edam_data": ["data_2044", "data_2044"]}, "multiple": false, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "tag": null}]}], "test_param": {"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "wildcard_annotation_model", "argument": null, "type": "select", "label": "WildCARD annotation model type", "help": "Controls which WildCARD annotation FASTA is passed to rgi load. 'Homolog models only' is sufficient for standard variant detection. 'All model types' loads the extended WildCARD annotation database \u2014 required when using Include other model types.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "homolog", "options": [["Homolog models only", "homolog", true], ["All model types", "all", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}}, {"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "wildcard_index", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "WildCARD index file", "help": "index-for-model-sequences.txt from the WildCARD archive. Extract card-variants.tar.bz2 and decompress index-for-model-sequences.txt.gz from inside it to obtain this plain-text file.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt", "tabular"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330", "format_3475"], "edam_data": ["data_0006", "data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "tag": null}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "wildcard_version", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "WildCARD version string", "help": "Version of the WildCARD data being loaded, e.g. 4.0.0. Find the version number in the WildCARD release notes at https://card.mcmaster.ca/download \u2014 it corresponds to the card-variants.tar.bz2 archive you downloaded.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "", "area": false, "datalist": []}]}], "test_param": {"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "source", "argument": null, "type": "select", "label": "WildCARD variant database", "help": "", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "none", "options": [["Do not load WildCARD", "none", true], ["Use a database installed by the administrator", "cached", false], ["Use files from your history", "history", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}}, {"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "aligner", "argument": "-a", "type": "select", "label": "Read aligner", "help": "kma is optimised for metagenomics and handles redundant reference sequences efficiently. bowtie2 and bwa produce standard SAM/BAM output and are suitable when downstream tools require those formats.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "kma", "options": [["kma (recommended)", "kma", true], ["bowtie2", "bowtie2", false], ["bwa", "bwa", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}, {"model_class": "BooleanToolParameter", "name": "include_wildcard", "argument": "--include_wildcard", "type": "boolean", "label": "Include wildcard variants (WildCARD)", "help": "Also align reads against in silico predicted AMR gene variants from WildCARD. Improves detection of resistance variants not yet in canonical CARD. Requires a WildCARD database to be loaded above.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": false, "truevalue": "--include_wildcard", "falsevalue": ""}, {"model_class": "BooleanToolParameter", "name": "include_other_models", "argument": "--include_other_models", "type": "boolean", "label": "Include other model types", "help": "Also align against protein variant, rRNA variant, knockout, and protein overexpression models in addition to the default homolog models. Requires the 'All model types' annotation FASTA to be loaded for CARD (and WildCARD if enabled).", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": false, "truevalue": "--include_other_models", "falsevalue": ""}, {"model_class": "Section", "name": "read_filters", "type": "section", "title": "Read mapping filters", "help": null, "expanded": false, "inputs": [{"model_class": "IntegerToolParameter", "name": "mapq", "argument": "--mapq", "type": "integer", "label": "Minimum MAPQ score", "help": "Discard alignments below this mapping quality score. MAPQ 0 indicates a non-unique alignment; MAPQ 20 corresponds to a 1% chance of mis-mapping. Leave empty to keep all alignments.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "min": 0, "max": null, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "IntegerToolParameter", "name": "mapped", "argument": "--mapped", "type": "integer", "label": "Minimum mapped read count", "help": "Discard AMR references with fewer than this many mapped reads. Useful for removing low-confidence hits in low-depth samples. Leave empty to disable.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "min": 0, "max": null, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "FloatToolParameter", "name": "coverage", "argument": "--coverage", "type": "float", "label": "Minimum reference coverage (%)", "help": "Discard AMR references where fewer than this percentage of the reference length is covered by reads. Typical cutoffs range from 80 to 100%. Leave empty to disable.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "min": 0.0, "max": 100.0, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}]}], "outputs": [{"model_class": "ToolOutput", "name": "allele_mapping_txt", "format": "tabular", "label": "${tool.name} on ${on_string}: allele mapping (tabular)", "hidden": false, "output_type": "data", "format_source": null, "default_identifier_source": "None", "metadata_source": null, "parent": null, "count": 1, "from_work_dir": "staging/output.allele_mapping_data.txt", "edam_format": "format_3475", "edam_data": "data_0006", "discover_datasets": []}, {"model_class": "ToolOutput", "name": "allele_mapping_json", "format": "json", "label": "${tool.name} on ${on_string}: allele mapping (JSON)", "hidden": false, "output_type": "data", "format_source": null, "default_identifier_source": "None", "metadata_source": null, "parent": null, "count": 1, "from_work_dir": "staging/output.allele_mapping_data.json", "edam_format": "format_3464", "edam_data": "data_0006", "discover_datasets": []}, {"model_class": "ToolOutput", "name": "gene_mapping_txt", "format": "tabular", "label": "${tool.name} on ${on_string}: gene mapping (tabular)", "hidden": false, "output_type": "data", "format_source": null, "default_identifier_source": "None", "metadata_source": null, "parent": null, "count": 1, "from_work_dir": "staging/output.gene_mapping_data.txt", "edam_format": "format_3475", "edam_data": "data_0006", "discover_datasets": []}, {"model_class": "ToolOutput", "name": "overall_mapping_stats", "format": "txt", "label": "${tool.name} on ${on_string}: overall mapping stats", "hidden": false, "output_type": "data", "format_source": null, "default_identifier_source": "None", "metadata_source": null, "parent": null, "count": 1, "from_work_dir": "staging/output.overall_mapping_stats.txt", "edam_format": "format_2330", "edam_data": "data_0006", "discover_datasets": []}, {"model_class": "ToolOutput", "name": "reference_mapping_stats"